## Tool chrome contracts

- Canvas tools: [`ToolEditorLayout`](src/components/tools/ToolEditorLayout.tsx) — sticky asymmetric preview at `lg`/`xl`; mobile Edit/Preview with **`aria-controls`** / panel ids; optional `purposeHint` (“when to use”); `exportError` + **`exportSuccess`** via [`useExportHandler`](src/hooks/use-export-handler.ts).
- Cross-links: [`ToolRelatedFooter`](src/components/tools/ToolRelatedFooter.tsx) / `RELATED_BY_TOOL` — add entries when shipping a new public tool.
- Tools index: one-line `toolsIndex.blurbs.*` per nav key; densify grids at `sm`/`lg`/`xl`.
- Captions page chrome is i18n (`captions.*`); caption **bodies** may stay EN until multi-union content lands — avoid hardcoded national-union hashtags (`#OPSEU`); prefer `#LocalUnion` + `[Local Number]` placeholders.

## Responsive

Spot-check **375 / 768 / 1280 / 1536**. Re-touch surfaces marked “done” in [`tool-editor-ux.mdc`](tool-editor-ux.mdc) when the four-width check fails. Document-generator / alt-text remain layout exceptions — still reduce mobile scroll friction when touching those pages.

## Do not

- Leak env vars, cron paths, or `*_DB_BACKEND` into public tool/guide copy for volunteers  
- Hardcode OPSEU/CAAT as the only local identity in new workshop copy  
- Invent one-off `max-w-*` page shells — use `PageShell` / `PAGE_SHELL`
